steak: So anyway. Time to get serious considering I don’t have much time left here.
character: Wait what? How much time do you all have anyway?!
steak: You all?
character: Oh nothing.
steak: Well I only got like 1 minute left.
character: 1 MINUTE!? WHY ARE YOU JUST TELLING ME NOW!!!!?
if {SteakTeach} == "Teach":
	steak: Because I was enjoying teaching you Partner!
elif {SteakComfort} == "Comfort":
	steak: Because I was enjoying talking to you Partner!
elif {SteakMovie} == "Movie":
	steak: Because I was enjoying the movie talk Partner!
character: Wow yea.. Now that I think about it. You have opened up a lot more as well.
steak: Ya really think I have?
- Wish we could talk more
	character: And I wish I could have talked to you more!
	steak: Wait, are you saying you want to? Keep talking to me?
	character: Yea let’s catch up later?
- Nice to talk to.
	character: And I think you're pretty nice to talk to.
	steak: I would love to keep this conversation going but I really do have to go.
	character: Aww I guess I will be saying bye now then huh?
steak: Yea… Alright! I’ll see ya later then Partner!
character: See ya partner!.
steak: Reapers finally calling my name.
character: Wha.. ok?
